# brace-expansion 1.x (exceljs -> archiver -> glob@7 -> minimatch@3) has no
# in-major fix for this DoS; the only "fixed" release is the 5.x line, which
# minimatch@3 cannot use. The vulnerable code path expands brace patterns,
# and on this dependency chain patterns are library-internal constants, never
# user input. Re-evaluate when exceljs/archiver move off glob@7.
CVE-2026-14257
